# Native shells. These are generated from capacitor.config.ts with
# `npm run mobile:add` and are not checked in: they need Xcode / Android Studio
# to build or change, and the per-deployment pieces that do belong in them
# (google-services.json, the APNs capability, signing) are secrets or come from
# your own Apple/Google accounts. See docs/MOBILE_APP_PLAN.md.
